sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant W as 🌐 Web App<br/>(your-domain.example)
    participant DB as 🗄️ Supabase DB
    participant CJ as ⏰ cron-job.org
    participant API as 🔌 /api/cron<br/>(Vercel)
    participant SEND as 🔌 /api/zalo/send
    participant FN as ⚡ func.vn API
    participant Z as 💬 Zalo Group

    Note over U,Z: 📋 GIAI ĐOẠN 1 - Tạo lịch gửi
    U->>W: Tạo Đợt gửi<br/>(message, image, scheduled_at)
    W->>DB: INSERT campaigns<br/>status='scheduled'
    W->>DB: INSERT campaign_groups<br/>(1 row mỗi nhóm Zalo)
    DB-->>W: ✅ Saved
    W-->>U: "Đã lên lịch gửi"

    Note over U,Z: ⏱️ GIAI ĐOẠN 2 - Cron tự động (mỗi 1 phút)
    loop Every 1 minute
        CJ->>API: GET /api/cron<br/>Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET
        API->>API: Validate token
        API->>DB: SELECT campaigns<br/>WHERE status='scheduled'<br/>AND scheduled_at <= NOW()
        Note right of API: Dùng SERVICE_ROLE_KEY<br/>để bypass RLS

        alt Có campaign đến hạn
            DB-->>API: [campaign1, campaign2, ...]

            loop For each campaign
                API->>SEND: POST /api/zalo/send<br/>{campaignId}<br/>x-cron-secret header

                SEND->>DB: SELECT campaign_groups<br/>JOIN zalo_groups, api_keys
                DB-->>SEND: groups + tokens

                SEND->>DB: UPDATE campaigns<br/>status='sending'

                loop For each group
                    alt Có ảnh đính kèm
                        SEND->>FN: POST group_send_images<br/>{group_id, urls[]}<br/>Bearer token
                        FN->>Z: Gửi ảnh
                        FN-->>SEND: 200 OK / Failed
                    end

                    SEND->>FN: POST group_send_message<br/>{group_id, message}<br/>Bearer token
                    FN->>Z: Gửi tin nhắn
                    FN-->>SEND: 200 OK / Failed

                    SEND->>DB: UPDATE campaign_groups<br/>status='sent'/'failed'<br/>sent_at, error_message

                    Note right of SEND: Delay 1 giây<br/>tránh rate limit
                end

                SEND->>DB: UPDATE campaigns<br/>status='sent'/'partial'/'failed'
                SEND-->>API: {success, sent, failed}
            end

            API-->>CJ: {message: "Done", count: N, results: [...]}
        else Không có campaign
            DB-->>API: []
            API-->>CJ: {message: "No campaigns", count: 0}
        end
    end

    Note over U,Z: 👀 GIAI ĐOẠN 3 - User xem kết quả
    U->>W: Mở trang Đợt gửi
    W->>DB: SELECT campaigns + campaign_groups
    DB-->>W: campaign data + per-group status
    W-->>U: 📊 Hiển thị:<br/>✅ Thành công: X<br/>❌ Thất bại: Y
